## Additional Terms for Django Production Boilerplate

This software is a production-ready Django boilerplate created by Pallav Rai.
While this software is released under the MIT License, users are encouraged
to provide attribution when using this boilerplate in their projects.

### Attribution Requirements (Recommended)
When using this boilerplate in your projects, please consider:
1. Keeping this license file in your project
2. Adding attribution in your project's README or documentation
3. Mentioning the original author (Pallav Rai) in your project credits

### Commercial Use
This software may be used for commercial purposes under the terms of the MIT License.
No additional permissions are required, but attribution is appreciated.

### Contact
For questions about this license or the software, please contact:
- Author: Pallav Rai
- Project: Django Production Boilerplate

This boilerplate includes integrations with:
- Django 4.2+ Framework
- Django REST Framework
- PostgreSQL with PostGIS
- Redis and Celery
- Django Unfold Admin Interface
- And other modern web development tools

